DESIGN
  • Full-screen "story" deck (web `fixed inset-0 bg-black`), fixed-dark (SlideInk on black) so it reads
    identically in light/dark, exactly matching the web `text-white` slides.
  • Reuses the shared SlideRenderer infrastructure (same TeslaSync module): SlideRendererProjector +
    SlideDispatchContent + SlideGradientBackground + SlideTransitionContainer render each data-bound
    slide body; the page owns the chrome. The 12-slide deck is the verbatim port of web `SLIDE_DEFS`.
  • @Observable YearReviewPageModel binds the KMP-backed `YearReviewDataSource` seam
    (web hooks useVehicles → GET /vehicles, useYearReview → GET /analytics/year-review). No networking in the view.
  • Adaptive (ADR-002/006): desktop arrow hints at regular width (web `md:`); tap zones + swipe +
    (macOS) keyboard arrows/space/escape drive navigation. a11y labels on every control; VoiceOver
    page label = pageTitle; SI values formatted at the display boundary by the slide projector.

